{"route":"/docs/4.5/getting-started/download/","version":"4.5","renderedVersion":"4.5","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Download","level":1},"lead":{"id":"page--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/blob/v4.5.3/site/docs/4.5/getting-started/download.md\">View on GitHub</a>"},"blocks":[{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Download Bootstrap to get the compiled CSS and JavaScript, source code, or include it with your favorite package managers like npm, RubyGems, and more."},{"id":"compiled-css-and-js","type":"heading","en":"Compiled CSS and JS","level":2},{"id":"compiled-css-and-js--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Download ready-to-use compiled code for <strong>Bootstrap v4.5.3</strong> to easily drop into your project, which includes:"},{"id":"compiled-css-and-js--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"compiled-css-and-js--item-1","type":"item","en":"Compiled and minified CSS bundles (see <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/contents/#css-files\">CSS files comparison</a>)"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"compiled-css-and-js--item-2","type":"item","en":"Compiled and minified JavaScript plugins"}]}]},{"id":"compiled-css-and-js--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"This doesn’t include documentation, source files, or any optional JavaScript dependencies (jQuery and Popper.js)."},{"id":"compiled-css-and-js--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/releases/download/v4.5.3/bootstrap-4.5.3-dist.zip\">Download</a>"},{"id":"source-files","type":"heading","en":"Source files","level":2},{"id":"source-files--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Compile Bootstrap with your own asset pipeline by downloading our source Sass, JavaScript, and documentation files. This option requires some additional tooling:"},{"id":"source-files--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"source-files--item-1","type":"item","en":"Sass compiler (Libsass or Ruby Sass is supported) for compiling your CSS."}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"source-files--item-2","type":"item","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer\">Autoprefixer</a> for CSS vendor prefixing"}]}]},{"id":"source-files--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Should you require <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/build-tools/#tooling-setup\">build tools</a>, they are included for developing Bootstrap and its docs, but they’re likely unsuitable for your own purposes."},{"id":"source-files--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/archive/v4.5.3.zip\">Download source</a>"},{"id":"examples","type":"heading","en":"Examples","level":2},{"id":"examples--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you want to download and examine our <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/examples/\">examples</a>, you can grab the already built examples:"},{"id":"examples--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap/releases/download/v4.5.3/bootstrap-4.5.3-examples.zip\">Download Examples</a>"},{"id":"jsdelivr","type":"heading","en":"jsDelivr","level":2},{"id":"jsdelivr--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Skip the download with <a href=\"https://www.jsdelivr.com/\">jsDelivr</a> to deliver cached version of Bootstrap’s compiled CSS and JS to your project."},{"id":"jsdelivr--code-1","type":"code","value":"<link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.5.3/dist/css/bootstrap.min.css\" integrity=\"sha384-TX8t27EcRE3e/ihU7zmQxVncDAy5uIKz4rEkgIXeMed4M0jlfIDPvg6uqKI2xXr2\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\">\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.5.3/dist/js/bootstrap.bundle.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-ho+j7jyWK8fNQe+A12Hb8AhRq26LrZ/JpcUGGOn+Y7RsweNrtN/tE3MoK7ZeZDyx\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>","language":"html"},{"id":"jsdelivr--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"If you’re using our compiled JavaScript and prefer to include Popper.js separately, add Popper.js before our JS, via a CDN preferably."},{"id":"jsdelivr--code-2","type":"code","value":"<script src=\"https://code.jquery.com/jquery-3.5.1.slim.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-DfXdz2htPH0lsSSs5nCTpuj/zy4C+OGpamoFVy38MVBnE+IbbVYUew+OrCXaRkfj\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/popper.js@1.16.1/dist/umd/popper.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-9/reFTGAW83EW2RDu2S0VKaIzap3H66lZH81PoYlFhbGU+6BZp6G7niu735Sk7lN\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap@4.5.3/dist/js/bootstrap.min.js\" integrity=\"sha384-w1Q4orYjBQndcko6MimVbzY0tgp4pWB4lZ7lr30WKz0vr/aWKhXdBNmNb5D92v7s\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\"></script>","language":"html"},{"id":"package-managers","type":"heading","en":"Package managers","level":2},{"id":"package-managers--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Pull in Bootstrap’s <strong>source files</strong> into nearly any project with some of the most popular package managers. No matter the package manager, Bootstrap will <strong>require a Sass compiler and <a href=\"https://github.com/postcss/autoprefixer\">Autoprefixer</a></strong> for a setup that matches our official compiled versions."},{"id":"npm","type":"heading","en":"npm","level":3},{"id":"npm--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Install Bootstrap in your Node.js powered apps with <a href=\"https://www.npmjs.com/package/bootstrap\">the npm package</a>:"},{"id":"npm--code-1","type":"code","value":"npm install bootstrap","language":"sh"},{"id":"npm--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"<code>require(&#39;bootstrap&#39;)</code> will load all of Bootstrap’s jQuery plugins onto the jQuery object. The <code>bootstrap</code> module itself does not export anything. You can manually load Bootstrap’s jQuery plugins individually by loading the <code>/js/*.js</code> files under the package’s top-level directory."},{"id":"npm--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap’s <code>package.json</code> contains some additional metadata under the following keys:"},{"id":"npm--list-1","type":"list","tag":"ul","items":[{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"npm--item-1","type":"item","en":"<code>sass</code> - path to Bootstrap’s main <a href=\"https://sass-lang.com/\">Sass</a> source file"}]},{"tag":"li","body":[{"id":"npm--item-2","type":"item","en":"<code>style</code> - path to Bootstrap’s non-minified CSS that’s been precompiled using the default settings (no customization)"}]}]},{"id":"yarn","type":"heading","en":"yarn","level":3},{"id":"yarn--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Install Bootstrap in your Node.js powered apps with <a href=\"https://yarnpkg.com/en/package/bootstrap\">the yarn package</a>:"},{"id":"yarn--code-1","type":"code","value":"yarn add bootstrap","language":"sh"},{"id":"rubygems","type":"heading","en":"RubyGems","level":3},{"id":"rubygems--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Install Bootstrap in your Ruby apps using <a href=\"https://bundler.io/\">Bundler</a> (<strong>recommended</strong>) and <a href=\"https://rubygems.org/\">RubyGems</a> by adding the following line to your <a href=\"https://bundler.io/gemfile.html\"><code>Gemfile</code></a>:"},{"id":"rubygems--code-1","type":"code","value":"gem 'bootstrap', '~> 4.5.3'","language":"ruby"},{"id":"rubygems--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Alternatively, if you’re not using Bundler, you can install the gem by running this command:"},{"id":"rubygems--code-2","type":"code","value":"gem install bootstrap -v 4.5.3","language":"sh"},{"id":"rubygems--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://github.com/twbs/bootstrap-rubygem/blob/master/README.md\">See the gem’s README</a> for further details."},{"id":"composer","type":"heading","en":"Composer","level":3},{"id":"composer--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"You can also install and manage Bootstrap’s Sass and JavaScript using <a href=\"https://getcomposer.org/\">Composer</a>:"},{"id":"composer--code-1","type":"code","value":"composer require twbs/bootstrap:4.5.3","language":"sh"},{"id":"nuget","type":"heading","en":"NuGet","level":3},{"id":"nuget--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"If you develop in .NET, you can also install and manage Bootstrap’s <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/bootstrap/\">CSS</a> or <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/packages/bootstrap.sass/\">Sass</a> and JavaScript using <a href=\"https://www.nuget.org/\">NuGet</a>:"},{"id":"nuget--code-1","type":"code","value":"Install-Package bootstrap","language":"powershell"},{"id":"nuget--code-2","type":"code","value":"Install-Package bootstrap.sass","language":"powershell"}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Getting started","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Theming","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/theming/"},{"en":"Build tools","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/build-tools/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"Layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/overview/"},{"en":"Grid","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/grid/"},{"en":"Utilities for layout","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/4.5/layout/utilities-for-layout/"},{"en":"Content","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/d